#%RAML 1.0 ResourceType
usage: |
  Apply to a collection-style resource such as /customers. Describes structure only —
  apply correlation-id and common-error-responses traits explicitly per method in the
  API root RAML (e.g. is: [common.correlation-id, common.common-error-responses]),
  since trait names referenced from inside an included resourceType fragment cannot
  resolve against the including file's library context.
description: A collection of <<resourcePathName>>.
get?:
  description: Retrieve a list of <<resourcePathName>>.
post?:
  description: Create a new <<resourcePathName|!singularize>>.
